From efd105ebf6b1b269e0cca07ab731d844f24c2223 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 06:50:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(docker): build vaqtida import tekshiruvi va serverda
 jim build'ni bloklash
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Prod'da bot "ImportError: cannot import name 'admin' from 'handlers'
(unknown location)" bilan yiqildi. Bu xabar aynan bitta holatda chiqadi:
image ichida /app/handlers/ papkasi bor, lekin bo'sh — ya'ni image
to'liq bo'lmagan kontekstdan qurilgan.

Repo o'zi toza (fayllar joyida, .dockerignore ularni chiqarmaydi,
CRLF/BOM yo'q), shuning uchun sabab — serverdagi jimgina local build
yoki eski image. Ikkalasi ham yopildi:

- Dockerfile'ga build vaqtidagi tekshiruv qo'shildi: handlers fayllari
  borligi va `import main` ishlashi tekshiriladi. Endi buzuq image
  umuman qurilmaydi — xato CI'da, deploy'gacha chiqadi.
- deploy'da `docker compose up -d --no-build` — image tortilmasa compose
  serverdagi kontekstdan o'zi qurib qo'ymaydi, xato yashirinmaydi.
- Deploy log'ida qaysi image ishlayotgani (tag + digest) chop etiladi.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SUZWkXPXKbL48rSKg3HBXY
